      "id": "claim_78efa95b20e14f2b96b1581ecd94480c",
      "statement": "Duplicate detection is opt-in, runs after the sold-out check, takes a per-owner transaction-scoped advisory lock on Postgres (no-op on SQLite, requiring a live caller-owned session), re-runs the idempotency replay under the lock, and raises DuplicateBookingError with an id-bearing marker and all matching bookings.",
